WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:08.575
&gt;&gt; Ladies and gentlemen,
please welcome back Director,

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:12.946
Product Management,
Google, Greg DeMichillie.

00:00:12.946 --> 00:00:18.251
[ Music ]

00:00:18.251 --> 00:00:19.119
&gt;&gt; Greg: Good morning.

00:00:19.119 --> 00:00:21.388
Welcome back to day
two of GCP Next.

00:00:21.388 --> 00:00:23.156
Thank you all for coming back.

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:25.458
I hope you had a
good day yesterday.

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:28.128
I hope you had fun at
the after dark party.

00:00:28.128 --> 00:00:29.462
Did folks make that?

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:31.498
Good, good.

00:00:31.498 --> 00:00:34.768
I hope you get time or have had
